<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head><link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba</title>
    <style>
        /* CSS Styling */
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #121212;
            color: #ffffff;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        /* Header & Navigation */
        header {
            background-color: #050505;
            padding: 1rem 2rem;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            border-bottom: 3px solid #800000;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }

        .logo {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #ff4d4d;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }

        nav a {
            color: #ffffff;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin-left: 1.5rem;
            transition: color 0.3s ease;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ff4d4d;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero {
            height: 50vh;
            background: linear-gradient(rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7), rgba(18, 18, 18, 1)), 
                        url('https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578632767115-351597cf2477?q=80&w=1200') center/cover no-repeat;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: #ff4d4d;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 4px #000;
        }

        .hero p {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 600px;
            color: #dddddd;
        }

        /* Main Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1100px;
            margin: 3rem auto;
            padding: 0 1rem;
        }

        .section-title {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            color: #ff4d4d;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #333;
            padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        /* Characters Grid */
        .character-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 1.5rem;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
        }

        .card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-5px);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(255, 77, 77, 0.3);
        }

        .card-content {
            padding: 1.2rem;
        }

        .card-title {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .card-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #ff4d4d;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .card-desc {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #aaa;
        }

        /* Project & Contact Info Cards */
        .info-box {
            background-color: #1e1e1e;
            border: 1px solid #333;
            border-left: 4px solid #ff4d4d;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .contact-list {
            list-style: none;
            margin-top: 1rem;
        }

        .contact-list li {
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .contact-list a {
            color: #ff4d4d;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .contact-list a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        /* Footer */
        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 2rem;
            background-color: #050505;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Navigation Header -->
    <header>
        <div class="logo">Demon Slayer</div>
        <nav>
            <a href="#home">Home</a>
            <a href="#about-story">Story</a>
            <a href="#characters">Characters</a>
            <a href="#about-project">About Project</a>
            <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
        </nav>
    </header>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero" id="home">
        <h1>Destroy All Demons</h1>
        <p>Follow Tanjiro Kamado on his journey to turn his sister back into a human and avenge his family.</p>
    </section>

    <!-- Anime Story Section -->
    <div class="container" id="about-story">
        <h2 class="section-title">The Story</h2>
        <blockquote style="background: #1e1e1e; padding: 1.5rem; border-left: 4px solid #ff4d4d;">
            Since ancient times, rumors have persisted of man-eating demons lurking in the woods. Because of this, the local townsfolk never venture outside at night. Legend has it that a Demon Slayer also roams the night, hunting down these bloodthirsty demons.
        </blockquote>
    </div>

    <!-- Characters Section -->
    <div class="container" id="characters">
        <h2 class="section-title">Main Characters</h2>
        <div class="character-grid">
            
            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Tanjiro Kamado</h3>
                    <p class="card-subtitle">Water & Sun Breathing</p>
                    <p class="card-desc">A kind-hearted boy with an acute sense of smell, determined to find a cure for Nezuko.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Nezuko Kamado</h3>
                    <p class="card-subtitle">Blood Demon Art</p>
                    <p class="card-desc">Tanjiro's younger sister who was turned into a demon, yet retains her human emotions.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Zenitsu Agatsuma</h3>
                    <p class="card-subtitle">Thunder Breathing</p>
                    <p class="card-desc">A cowardly slayer who reveals his true, lightning-fast potential when he falls asleep.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="card-content">
                    <h3 class="card-title">Inosuke Hashibira</h3>
                    <p class="card-subtitle">Beast Breathing</p>
                    <p class="card-desc">A wild boy raised by boars who uses custom dual blades and relies on raw instinct.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- About Project Section -->
    <div class="container" id="about-project">
        <h2 class="section-title">About The Project</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <p><strong>Project Overview:</strong> This web site is a practice fan page dedicated to the anime series <em>Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba</em>.</p>
            <br>
            <p><strong>Objective:</strong> Built as part of the Front-End Web Development program at <strong>FEI Institute</strong>, this project demonstrates foundational web skills including semantic HTML structure, CSS Flexbox/Grid layouts, custom dark theme styling, and responsive design.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Contacts / Developer Profile Section -->
    <div class="container" id="contact">
        <h2 class="section-title">Developer & Contact</h2>
        <div class="info-box">
            <h3>Nolan Sheppard</h3>
            <p style="color: #ff4d4d; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">Student Developer — FEI Institute</p>
            <p>Currently studying modern front-end web development techniques, crafting responsive web layouts, and building interactive web experiences.</p>
            
            <ul class="contact-list">
                <li><strong>Institution:</strong> FEI Institute</li>
                <li><strong>Role:</strong> Front-End Coding Student</li>
                <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:nolwash.255@gmail.com">nolan.sheppard@example.com</a></li>
                <li><strong>GitHub:</strong> <a href="https://github.com" target="_blank">github.com/nolansheppard</a></li>
                <li><strong>LinkedIn:</strong> <a href="https://linkedin.com" target="_blank">linkedin.com/in/nolansheppard</a></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <footer>
        <p>&copy; Built by Nolan Sheppard | FEI Institute Front-End Web Development Project</p>
    </footer>

</body>
